1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,654
Characters, actions, places, occupations, and events in this series are fictional and created for entertainment purposes only.

2
00:00:08,654 --> 00:00:13,331
They are not intended to urge or promote any behavior in the series.

3
00:00:13,331 --> 00:00:15,743
Viewer discretion is advised.

4
00:01:16,487 --> 00:01:17,054
Hey.

5
00:01:18,342 --> 00:01:19,459
If you’re going to do that,

6
00:01:19,738 --> 00:01:20,825
can you do it somewhere else?

7
00:01:22,885 --> 00:01:24,251
The upper floors are a hotel.

8
00:01:24,702 --> 00:01:25,649
It has rooms available.

9
00:01:26,936 --> 00:01:28,073
Who are you?

10
00:01:28,352 --> 00:01:29,548
This is none of your business.

11
00:01:29,741 --> 00:01:31,186
I own this place.

12
00:01:31,894 --> 00:01:33,628
If you don’t want to spend the night
at the hotel,

13
00:01:34,186 --> 00:01:35,916
do you want to spend time in jail instead?

14
00:01:43,868 --> 00:01:44,869
Let’s go.

15
00:01:45,813 --> 00:01:47,120
This is ruining my mood.

16
00:01:48,386 --> 00:01:49,422
You should leave.

17
00:01:49,615 --> 00:01:50,740
I’ll see you later.

18
00:01:50,740 --> 00:01:51,244
What?

19
00:01:51,523 --> 00:01:52,379
Are you serious?

20
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:54,932
Yes.

21
00:01:55,554 --> 00:01:56,944
I don’t want to go with you anymore.

22
00:01:57,395 --> 00:01:58,421
Damn it.

23
00:02:17,873 --> 00:02:19,084
Why did you get in the car?

24
00:02:19,084 --> 00:02:20,459
I want to be your sugar baby.

25
00:02:21,339 --> 00:02:22,921
I want you to adore me.

26
00:02:25,668 --> 00:02:26,925
I’m good at pampering.

27
00:02:28,019 --> 00:02:29,007
Please take me.

28
00:02:29,822 --> 00:02:31,053
What the hell are you saying?

29
00:02:33,328 --> 00:02:34,249
What are you doing?

30
00:02:35,279 --> 00:02:36,724
The other night.

31
00:02:38,119 --> 00:02:41,958
When the light went off, you stopped talking.

32
00:02:42,773 --> 00:02:44,029
I thought…

33
00:02:46,046 --> 00:02:47,677
you may prefer it when it’s dark.

34
00:03:20,711 --> 00:03:22,020
You still haven’t told me

35
00:03:23,458 --> 00:03:25,254
why you got the moon tattoo.

36
00:03:49,969 --> 00:03:51,199
Why are you crying?

37
00:05:04,393 --> 00:05:05,939
2 DAYS AGO.

38
00:05:05,939 --> 00:05:08,285
The renovation on the 11th floor
started today, right?

39
00:05:08,478 --> 00:05:09,527
Yes, Miss Chan.

40
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:12,053
The construction will be completed
within seven days.

41
00:05:12,332 --> 00:05:14,334
Remind our staff that the entire floor is closed.

42
00:05:14,506 --> 00:05:16,913
I don’t want guests to stay on the floor
while the construction is ongoing.

43
00:05:17,492 --> 00:05:19,826
Do not cause any noise after 6 p.m.

44
00:05:20,384 --> 00:05:22,056
because it’s time for our guests to rest.

45
00:05:22,206 --> 00:05:23,359
Yes, Miss Chan.

46
00:05:28,145 --> 00:05:29,853
First impressions are important.

47
00:05:30,347 --> 00:05:31,869
Your name tag is also important.

48
00:05:32,019 --> 00:05:33,103
Yes, Miss Chan.

49
00:05:33,446 --> 00:05:34,759
I’m sorry.

50
00:05:37,420 --> 00:05:40,750
Miss Chan, Miss Sun is waiting in your office.

51
00:05:48,368 --> 00:05:49,093
Sun.

52
00:05:52,718 --> 00:05:54,137
Hello, sister.

53
00:05:54,781 --> 00:05:56,317
Why are you here to see me?

54
00:05:56,639 --> 00:06:00,665
I have to attend a gala party tonight.

55
00:06:00,923 --> 00:06:02,333
But I don’t want to go.

56
00:06:02,998 --> 00:06:05,065
I’ve been filming for three days straight.

57
00:06:05,065 --> 00:06:06,440
I’m exhausted.

58
00:06:07,771 --> 00:06:08,653
So what?

59
00:06:09,104 --> 00:06:10,758
Can you go to the party as me?

60
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:12,603
Let’s switch for one day.

61
00:06:12,711 --> 00:06:13,999
Just like we did in high school.

62
00:06:13,999 --> 00:06:15,692
You performed on stage as me.

63
00:06:16,164 --> 00:06:18,083
I agreed to do that because you were sick.

64
00:06:18,491 --> 00:06:20,210
That was why I sang on stage.

65
00:06:22,850 --> 00:06:24,964
Speaking of singing,

66
00:06:27,260 --> 00:06:29,692
are you not interested in being a singer?

67
00:06:31,023 --> 00:06:34,025
When you were young,

68
00:06:34,197 --> 00:06:37,021
you said you wanted to be a singer,
and I would be an actress.

69
00:06:38,609 --> 00:06:39,316
No.

70
00:06:39,767 --> 00:06:41,504
I like doing business now.

71
00:06:41,504 --> 00:06:43,900
This is why you are Mom’s favorite.

72
00:06:44,179 --> 00:06:47,064
You do everything that she wants you to do.

73
00:06:47,708 --> 00:06:51,022
So this is all you want to say to me?

74
00:06:51,687 --> 00:06:55,860
Actually, I want you to go to the party with me.

75
00:06:56,268 --> 00:06:57,531
Can you go with me?

76
00:06:57,874 --> 00:06:59,466
I already booked a seat for you.

77
00:07:01,333 --> 00:07:03,861
You know I don’t like answering the press.

78
00:07:04,140 --> 00:07:07,875
But there will be a lot of pretty girls there.

79
00:07:07,875 --> 00:07:08,760
Sun.

80
00:07:11,335 --> 00:07:13,157
You are so stubborn.

81
00:07:14,123 --> 00:07:16,741
Fine, I’m leaving.

82
00:07:21,333 --> 00:07:22,257
See you.

83
00:07:22,858 --> 00:07:23,522
Bye.

84
00:07:49,872 --> 00:07:52,609
I’LL TAKE YOU TO EAT DELICIOUS FOOD.

85
00:08:04,670 --> 00:08:06,173
Don’t forget to wake up to eat.

86
00:08:06,173 --> 00:08:06,954
Don’t sleep all day.

87
00:08:08,328 --> 00:08:09,054
I’m leaving.

88
00:08:26,320 --> 00:08:27,632
I’ll have an iced matcha as usual.

89
00:08:51,064 --> 00:08:51,828
Thank you.

90
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:07,774
It’s so good.

91
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,657
So refreshing.

92
00:09:40,224 --> 00:09:41,399
Do you have anything to say to me?

93
00:09:43,459 --> 00:09:44,701
You are cute.

94
00:09:48,864 --> 00:09:49,875
Are you hitting on me?

95
00:10:03,303 --> 00:10:04,255
It’s just a compliment.

96
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:06,881
Thank you.

97
00:10:07,997 --> 00:10:09,202
You are cute too.

98
00:10:11,434 --> 00:10:12,330
I know.

99
00:10:13,811 --> 00:10:15,248
Otherwise, you wouldn’t smile at me.

100
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:19,598
I smiled because I’ve never seen anyone
get that excited about food.

101
00:10:20,564 --> 00:10:21,855
It tastes really good.

102
00:10:22,585 --> 00:10:23,497
Do you want to taste it?

103
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,309
I’ll ask for a new straw.

104
00:10:31,309 --> 00:10:33,167
No, it’s okay.

105
00:10:40,485 --> 00:10:41,322
How is it?

106
00:10:42,631 --> 00:10:43,567
Believe me now?

107
00:10:45,713 --> 00:10:49,486
Before work, I always eat something delicious.

108
00:10:50,301 --> 00:10:52,818
I’m a regular customer here.

109
00:10:53,870 --> 00:10:56,739
Their drinks and food are great.

110
00:10:59,057 --> 00:11:01,428
I think I’ll become
a regular customer here too.

111
00:11:04,797 --> 00:11:11,052
Then I hope we will run into each other often.

112
00:11:14,657 --> 00:11:15,628
What’s your name?

113
00:11:17,366 --> 00:11:22,437
I’ll tell you when we become acquaintances.

114
00:11:23,059 --> 00:11:26,530
I hope we will become acquaintances.

115
00:11:29,706 --> 00:11:30,733
Do you want another sip?

116
00:11:31,355 --> 00:11:32,804
No, thanks.

117
00:11:35,186 --> 00:11:36,320
I won’t bother you anymore.

118
00:11:45,241 --> 00:11:46,482
Can I have a menu, please?

119
00:12:12,796 --> 00:12:14,549
When you play the intro,

120
00:12:14,871 --> 00:12:17,202
I’ll send you a signal, then you’ll start.

121
00:12:17,567 --> 00:12:18,977
Then the rest of you follow.

122
00:12:26,986 --> 00:12:28,112
Hello, Miss Chan.

123
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:40,747
Hello, we are The Petal.

124
00:12:41,477 --> 00:12:45,960
This is our first day performing
at the Crescent.

125
00:12:46,325 --> 00:12:50,078
I hope you will enjoy our music.

126
00:13:04,214 --> 00:13:09,139
♪ It’s late at night, have you got a ride? ♪

127
00:13:09,268 --> 00:13:14,261
♪ If you haven’t, here is my invite ♪

128
00:13:14,261 --> 00:13:17,520
♪ Wanna lock eyes a little longer ♪

129
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:20,317
♪ Can’t let you slip away farther ♪

130
00:13:20,317 --> 00:13:24,765
♪ Can we please spend more time together? ♪

131
00:13:26,446 --> 00:13:28,808
♪ The atmosphere’s just right ♪

132
00:13:28,808 --> 00:13:31,872
♪ That we’re here tonight ♪

133
00:13:31,872 --> 00:13:36,603
♪ It may be because I’m talking to you, to you ♪

134
00:13:36,603 --> 00:13:38,774
♪ Last two, won’t say goodbye ♪

135
00:13:38,774 --> 00:13:41,635
♪ Together, just you and I ♪

136
00:13:41,807 --> 00:13:46,012
♪ It may be because we feel the same,
the same ♪

137
00:13:46,012 --> 00:13:50,250
♪ Even though it’s time to part ♪

138
00:13:50,250 --> 00:13:54,274
♪ Still don’t want to be apart ♪

139
00:13:54,274 --> 00:13:59,142
♪ It’s late at night, have you got a ride? ♪

140
00:13:59,142 --> 00:14:04,034
♪ If you haven’t, here is my invite ♪

141
00:14:04,227 --> 00:14:07,541
♪ Wanna lock eyes a little longer ♪

142
00:14:07,541 --> 00:14:10,523
♪ Can’t let you slip away farther ♪

143
00:14:10,523 --> 00:14:14,249
♪ Can we please spend more time together? ♪

144
00:14:14,249 --> 00:14:17,253
♪ Wanna lock eyes a little longer ♪

145
00:14:17,253 --> 00:14:20,149
♪ Can’t let you slip away farther ♪

146
00:14:20,149 --> 00:14:25,126
♪ Can we please spend more time together? ♪

147
00:14:31,578 --> 00:14:32,873
I’m Key.

148
00:14:32,873 --> 00:14:34,504
This is my first day working here.

149
00:14:34,504 --> 00:14:35,853
Why did you get the moon tattoo?

150
00:14:35,853 --> 00:14:37,480
If you want to know,
you need to come with me.

